mission "The Compass of Dead Man's Cay"
    name "The Compass of Dead Man's Cay"
    description "Bring Rafael's brass compass to Nell in Port Royal and uncover the location of Vane's secret anchorage."
    source "Havana"
    destination "Port Royal"
    reward 580
    speaker offer "Don Rafael, Captain of the Watch"
    speaker visit "Nell the Chandlery Keeper"
    speaker complete "Nell the Chandlery Keeper"
    to offer
        has "The Shipwright's Secret: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Rafael waits by the eastern gate with a small leather case. "The compass inside belonged to a patrol captain who disappeared near Dead Man's Cay. The governor claimed his ship was lost in a storm. Tomas's plans suggest it was carrying supplies to Vane."`
            `"Take it to Nell in Port Royal. She knows the old pilot marks and can read the scratches around the compass dial."`
            choice
                `"I'll find Nell and learn where the compass points."`
                    goto accept_job
                `"Why not send one of your own officers?"`
                    goto question
                `"I have had enough of secret charts."`
                    goto decline_job
            label question
                `Rafael's expression darkens. "Because half my officers report to the governor. I trust you because you have already put your ship between these islands and Vane's guns."`
                choice
                    `"I'll carry it. Keep your own men close."`
                        goto accept_job
                    `"Then find someone else."`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `He gives you the case. "Do not open it at sea. The needle has been tampered with before, and I would rather not lose the only copy of the marks."`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `Rafael closes the case. "Very well. I will keep the compass hidden until another chance presents itself."`
                close
    on accept
        log "Taking Rafael's brass compass to Nell in Port Royal. Its marks may reveal Vane's hidden anchorage."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Nell holds the compass close to the lamp. Around the rim are tiny cuts, almost invisible beneath the green corrosion. She turns the case twice and then lays a chart beside it.`
            `"Dead Man's Cay. The compass does not point north; it points to the entrance of a hidden lagoon. Vane has been using it to gather his ships beyond the reefs."`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Nell marks the lagoon on your chart. "There is no fort there, only a narrow entrance and enough water for a fleet. If Vane gathers all his ships, he will sail from there and take every harbour on this coast."`
            `She looks toward the harbour mouth. "Port Royal's captains are ready to stand together. We need to break his scouts before the main fleet can assemble."`
        log "Located Vane's hidden anchorage at Dead Man's Cay. The pirate fleet is gathering there."
